        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, smartphone, medium intensity per GB</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, smartphone, medium intensity per GB
The data set represents the use of a laptop computer and internet use.; UUID: 156a6fde-00b0-3707-9200-ddc18d390cfd
This data set includes the use of a smartphone and the energy consumption on the end user side. Additionally, the energy and embodied impacts associated with the transmission network on the could are also included. Low intensity means that the device consumption is standard while data consumption is set at 1 GB per hour.
Location: Data for Swiss conditions
Technology: Using an average smartphone at active mode while consuming data via internet and transmission network, which includes wireless mobile network, IP core network, and global network.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_156a6fde-00b0-3707-9200-ddc18d390cfd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
